1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,826
[Damian] <i>Tell Madam Red Dragon</i>

4
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:36,202
<i>to start looking for my replacement.</i>

5
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:39,706
[Damian] <i>This isn't the life</i>
<i>I want for my loved ones.</i>

6
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:41,207
<i>I don't want to be the Jaguar.</i>

7
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:42,876
[Diego] <i>We don't have any</i>
<i>control over the future.</i>

8
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:44,586
<i>But we have tonight.</i>

9
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:48,173
<i>I want to spend the rest of my life</i>
<i>with my best friend.</i>

10
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:49,549
<i>Will you marry me?</i>

11
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:52,635
[Lily] <i>I will. Yes, I'll marry you.</i>

12
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:54,929
[Arnaldo] <i>I'll give you tonight.</i>

13
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:56,347
<i>But, tomorrow</i>

14
00:00:56,431 --> 00:00:58,475
<i>is a whole different story.</i>

15
00:00:58,558 --> 00:01:01,186
[Damian] <i>I'm the Jaguar,</i>
<i>I worked for Red Dragon.</i>

16
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,104
[Damian] Wait.

17
00:01:03,188 --> 00:01:04,939
[Camia] <i>Your uncle Damian</i>
<i>told me something.</i>

18
00:01:05,023 --> 00:01:06,733
[Lily] <i>It all makes sense now.</i>

19
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:09,027
<i>Uncle Damian sacrificed a lot for us.</i>

20
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:11,696
<i>He's doing it for us.</i>

21
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:13,198
[car door opens]

22
00:01:13,281 --> 00:01:14,616
<i>Get down!</i>

23
00:01:14,699 --> 00:01:15,992
[gunshots]

24
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:18,745
<i>-Lily!</i>
-[gun firing]

25
00:01:19,370 --> 00:01:22,957
<i>Lily! You bastards! Let Lily go!</i>

26
00:01:23,041 --> 00:01:25,710
[Julio] <i>You did very, very good.</i>

27
00:01:26,127 --> 00:01:29,964
<i>After everything that Lily Cruz</i>
<i>has put our family through,</i>

28
00:01:30,048 --> 00:01:32,383
<i>she deserves to suffer!</i>

29
00:01:41,309 --> 00:01:42,393
[Jepoy] Anna?

30
00:01:44,979 --> 00:01:46,981
Do you have news about
Lily and Auntie Camia?

31
00:01:47,065 --> 00:01:48,358
Where are they?

32
00:01:50,026 --> 00:01:50,985
[Anna] <i>Jepoy.</i>

33
00:01:53,029 --> 00:01:54,531
[Jepoy] <i>I didn't mean to.</i>

34
00:01:54,614 --> 00:01:55,782
<i>I didn't mean it.</i>

35
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:57,492
<i>You didn't mean it?</i>

36
00:01:59,077 --> 00:02:02,997
<i>You didn't mean to lie</i>
<i>and hurt me, huh, Jepoy?!</i>

37
00:02:06,876 --> 00:02:08,336
We don't know.

38
00:02:09,879 --> 00:02:11,339
Then what are you still doing here?

39
00:02:12,465 --> 00:02:14,884
Stop wasting your time
waiting around, Anna!

40
00:02:15,718 --> 00:02:18,680
We're doing everything we can
to find them, Jepoy.

41
00:02:18,763 --> 00:02:20,640
Don't take out your anger on us

42
00:02:20,723 --> 00:02:23,268
because you're the one who's always away!

43
00:02:27,147 --> 00:02:28,731
[Jepoy] I'm sorry, Anna.

44
00:02:30,483 --> 00:02:32,235
Don't worry, I'll look for them.

45
00:02:50,169 --> 00:02:51,546
Anna.

46
00:02:52,171 --> 00:02:54,632
We have to go to the precinct
and get some updates.

47
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,678
[Marlon] You ready?

48
00:03:06,185 --> 00:03:09,439
[tense music playing]

49
00:03:14,861 --> 00:03:17,697
Where are Camia and Lily?

50
00:03:20,158 --> 00:03:21,951
Come on, Jaguar…

51
00:03:22,368 --> 00:03:23,745
[henchwoman] How should I know?

52
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:30,043
Where are they?!

53
00:03:32,086 --> 00:03:34,797
Did you take them
to get back at me for leaving?

54
00:03:34,881 --> 00:03:36,633
[henchwoman] What did you expect?

55
00:03:37,175 --> 00:03:39,719
You know what we do to deserters.

56
00:03:39,802 --> 00:03:41,888
You owe Red Dragon your life.

57
00:03:41,971 --> 00:03:46,392
Now, if that Camia
and her daughter make you happy,

58
00:03:47,185 --> 00:03:50,188
then I'm sorry to say they're
both probably six feet under.

59
00:03:50,772 --> 00:03:52,440
You monsters!

60
00:03:53,566 --> 00:03:57,237
I'm trying to change
for the better because of Camia.

61
00:03:58,488 --> 00:04:00,573
If you hurt her…

62
00:04:01,157 --> 00:04:04,077
…you'll have to deal with a Jaguar worse

63
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,329
than the one you first met!

64
00:04:06,663 --> 00:04:09,791
[tense music swells]

65
00:04:18,341 --> 00:04:19,342
[Diego] Psst!

66
00:04:28,142 --> 00:04:28,893
[groans]

67
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:30,311
Hey. Where are they?

68
00:04:31,771 --> 00:04:32,772
Huh!

69
00:04:32,855 --> 00:04:35,024
Where are Lily and Camia?!

70
00:04:35,984 --> 00:04:37,151
Answer me!

71
00:04:38,611 --> 00:04:40,697
Ask Romulo! He knows where they are!

72
00:04:41,406 --> 00:04:42,907
Where is he, then?

73
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:45,952
[tense music continues]

74
00:04:46,494 --> 00:04:48,538
Where are they?!

75
00:04:48,621 --> 00:04:49,914
[henchwoman 2] Boss Jaguar!

76
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:55,420
Answer me!

77
00:04:55,503 --> 00:04:56,546
Romulo…

78
00:04:56,838 --> 00:04:58,381
He knows where they are.

79
00:04:58,673 --> 00:05:00,925
So where is Romulo?

80
00:05:08,057 --> 00:05:09,392
[Julio] Where is that…

81
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,477
-…woman?
-[Helena] I can't wait…

82
00:05:11,561 --> 00:05:13,271
-…to see her.
-That woman. Oh. There she is.

83
00:05:13,354 --> 00:05:14,147
There she is.

84
00:05:14,230 --> 00:05:18,192
-Speaking of.
-[Helena laughing]

85
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:20,570
[Julio] There.

86
00:05:20,653 --> 00:05:22,071
Looking so helpless!

87
00:05:22,155 --> 00:05:24,532
-Look at that.
-She looks… She looks like…

88
00:05:24,615 --> 00:05:27,410
[Helena] The helpless Lily Cruz!

89
00:05:28,369 --> 00:05:30,371
[Helena chuckles]

90
00:05:34,334 --> 00:05:35,752
[Julio] Good morning!

91
00:05:36,085 --> 00:05:38,087
-Good morning, Lily Cruz!
-[Helena laughing]

92
00:05:38,171 --> 00:05:42,091
Good morning! Hi! You're awake!

93
00:05:42,592 --> 00:05:44,552
Did you sleep well?

94
00:05:44,844 --> 00:05:46,679
[Julio] How's your morning?

95
00:05:50,016 --> 00:05:52,518
You're in handcuffs. Sorry about that.

96
00:05:53,019 --> 00:05:54,479
Oh, there she goes.

97
00:05:54,562 --> 00:05:56,522
So feisty!

98
00:05:56,939 --> 00:05:58,941
[Julio] That's why I don't
like waking her up!

99
00:05:59,484 --> 00:06:01,736
What is this about, Julio?

100
00:06:01,819 --> 00:06:03,154
[Helena scoffs]

101
00:06:05,073 --> 00:06:08,618
Where is my mother? Show me my mother!

102
00:06:08,701 --> 00:06:11,788
-She's ballsy, isn't she?
-[Julio] I told you!

103
00:06:12,497 --> 00:06:14,749
So you two are working together now?

104
00:06:14,832 --> 00:06:16,959
Is this a new form of torture?

105
00:06:17,043 --> 00:06:20,463
You know what? Just shoot me
and get it over with.

106
00:06:21,631 --> 00:06:23,299
[Julio] How fearless!

107
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:25,551
Why are you in such a hurry to die?

108
00:06:25,843 --> 00:06:26,677
[Julio and Helena] Oh!

109
00:06:26,761 --> 00:06:28,387
What the hell is this, Emilia?!

110
00:06:28,471 --> 00:06:29,889
[Emilia shushes]

111
00:06:29,972 --> 00:06:30,723
[Helena laughs]

112
00:06:30,807 --> 00:06:33,392
Mom! Mom! Mom!

113
00:06:33,476 --> 00:06:35,186
[Julio] There's your mother.

114
00:06:35,269 --> 00:06:36,145
Lily!

115
00:06:36,229 --> 00:06:38,147
[Lily] Emilia, you monster!

116
00:06:39,232 --> 00:06:41,651
-Drop that gun!
-[Emilia cackles]

117
00:06:42,110 --> 00:06:46,405
Quiet! Quiet! Quiet!
Quiet! Keep your voice down!

118
00:06:46,489 --> 00:06:48,491
I don't want to scare you but--

119
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:50,827
-[gunshot]
-[Emilia laughs]

120
00:06:51,119 --> 00:06:53,746
You know what happens
when I panic? I shoot my gun!

121
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,915
[laughing]

122
00:06:55,998 --> 00:06:57,542
-[gunshot]
-[Julio] Your daughter is nuts!

123
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:59,585
You're all insane, Julio!

124
00:06:59,669 --> 00:07:01,337
Emilia, please…

125
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:03,965
Kill me. Leave my mother alone, please.

126
00:07:04,048 --> 00:07:07,885
That's all I ask, Emilia!
Kill me and let my mother go!

127
00:07:08,136 --> 00:07:09,262
Shut up!

128
00:07:09,345 --> 00:07:10,346
-[Emilia laughs]
-[Helena] Typical.

129
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,265
Put the gun down!

130
00:07:12,348 --> 00:07:13,891
Lily!

131
00:07:14,684 --> 00:07:16,727
[whimpering]

132
00:07:16,811 --> 00:07:19,188
Mom. Mom.

133
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:22,608
-[Helena] Here we go.
-[Camia] No!

134
00:07:22,692 --> 00:07:24,861
Emilia, put your gun down!

135
00:07:25,653 --> 00:07:27,780
-[shushes]
-[Lily] Just kill me, instead!

136
00:07:27,864 --> 00:07:30,366
-[Helena] Chill!
-[laughs]

137
00:07:31,159 --> 00:07:32,577
Mom.

138
00:07:33,578 --> 00:07:36,247
-Lily! Don't!
-[Lily groans]

139
00:07:39,041 --> 00:07:42,462
-[tense music playing]
-[no audible dialogue]

140
00:07:42,545 --> 00:07:45,214
[screams]

141
00:07:47,967 --> 00:07:50,052
[laughs]

142
00:07:50,136 --> 00:07:51,679
[Camia] Lily!

143
00:07:55,641 --> 00:07:57,977
-Ten, nine, eight…
-[Helena chuckling]

144
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,061
[Julio] …seven,

145
00:07:59,145 --> 00:08:03,483
six, five, four, three…

146
00:08:04,609 --> 00:08:05,735
two…

147
00:08:06,652 --> 00:08:08,529
[Helena laughing]

148
00:08:08,613 --> 00:08:09,655
She's out!

149
00:08:09,739 --> 00:08:11,908
[Julio chuckling]

150
00:08:13,034 --> 00:08:14,619
[Julio] That's how you shut her up.

151
00:08:15,828 --> 00:08:17,705
-[Emilia] It's her turn now!
-Lily!

152
00:08:18,122 --> 00:08:19,582
It's your turn, don't be jealous!

153
00:08:19,665 --> 00:08:20,583
Do it now!

154
00:08:20,666 --> 00:08:22,668
[tense music swells]

155
00:08:24,504 --> 00:08:27,673
[Emilia] Ohhh! Enjoy!

156
00:08:27,757 --> 00:08:30,134
[laughs]

157
00:08:30,843 --> 00:08:32,261
[Emilia] Ah…

158
00:08:32,762 --> 00:08:34,847
[Emilia howls]

159
00:08:34,931 --> 00:08:39,060
[Emilia] I love it! Yes!
Sleeping time for these girls!

160
00:08:39,143 --> 00:08:42,271
-Like mother, like daughter.
-Yes!

161
00:08:43,773 --> 00:08:45,024
Knock out!

162
00:08:48,736 --> 00:08:50,738
[Emilia] Party, party!

163
00:08:58,788 --> 00:09:03,084
[Julio] Thank you. Oh!
Good morning, my queen!

164
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,585
Don't call me your queen.

165
00:09:04,669 --> 00:09:05,753
Mmm!

166
00:09:06,170 --> 00:09:07,547
Please?

167
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:12,176
Sit beside me, please. Or else…

168
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:14,095
[tense music plays]

169
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,305
Please?

170
00:09:23,688 --> 00:09:24,897
There.

171
00:09:25,523 --> 00:09:27,108
Now, that's better.

172
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:28,859
Okay.

173
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:32,405
Well, did you sleep well?

174
00:09:33,698 --> 00:09:35,157
Actually, I did.

175
00:09:35,533 --> 00:09:38,035
Wow! That's good. That's good.

176
00:09:38,119 --> 00:09:40,496
I had the most wonderful dream!

177
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:43,958
Oh. Not that I'm interrupting, but

178
00:09:44,041 --> 00:09:46,961
I did have a dream last night too.

179
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:48,462
What was your dream?

180
00:09:48,546 --> 00:09:51,340
I dreamt that I was a real red dragon…

181
00:09:51,424 --> 00:09:53,175
-[Julio] Oh.
-…with wings and all!

182
00:09:53,259 --> 00:09:56,971
But then, I got attacked
by a group of peasants led by

183
00:09:57,054 --> 00:09:59,432
that annoying Lily Cruz and her mom.

184
00:09:59,849 --> 00:10:01,183
What did you do, then?

185
00:10:01,267 --> 00:10:03,936
Well, I spit fire on them…

186
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:06,105
-Ouch!
-…and they turned into ash!

187
00:10:06,188 --> 00:10:07,815
[both laughing]

188
00:10:07,898 --> 00:10:09,191
What about you?

189
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:10,776
-[Julio] Oh.
-What did you dream about?

190
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:15,114
Well… Well, you know, I also had a dream,

191
00:10:15,197 --> 00:10:18,492
but it wasn't as fantabulous as yours.

192
00:10:19,493 --> 00:10:24,540
I dreamt about Romulo bashing
in the heads of Lily and Camia.

193
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:26,459
You know, you were there.

194
00:10:26,542 --> 00:10:28,794
You were preparing the dinner table.

195
00:10:28,878 --> 00:10:31,088
You were right beside the microwave oven

196
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:35,009
and you were about
to get their brains heated up

197
00:10:35,092 --> 00:10:37,053
so we could have it for dinner with…

198
00:10:37,136 --> 00:10:40,014
a very beautiful glass of wine.

199
00:10:40,097 --> 00:10:43,684
Wow! Sumptuous! Very, very yummy!

200
00:10:44,769 --> 00:10:47,980
And so, you see, my dear,
after all these years,

201
00:10:48,064 --> 00:10:51,025
we still think alike.

202
00:10:51,108 --> 00:10:53,444
And that's why you can't resist me.

203
00:10:53,527 --> 00:10:57,823
Oh, that's not the only thing
I can't resist. This.

204
00:10:57,907 --> 00:11:00,993
-Go get a room, please!
-Emilia, would you like me

205
00:11:01,077 --> 00:11:02,995
to get a baby brother for you? Adopt one?

206
00:11:03,079 --> 00:11:05,331
Unbelievable! No way! [groans]

207
00:11:05,414 --> 00:11:06,165
[Emilia and Julio laugh]

208
00:11:06,248 --> 00:11:08,834
[Emilia] Jen. Get me some water.

209
00:11:09,335 --> 00:11:13,005
-Oh, well.
-This looks yummy.

210
00:11:14,173 --> 00:11:17,593
[Damian groans]

211
00:11:25,393 --> 00:11:29,230
[grunting]

212
00:11:42,701 --> 00:11:44,620
<i>I'm coming, Camia.</i>

213
00:11:45,496 --> 00:11:49,500
<i>Not even death can stop me</i>
<i>from saving you.</i>

214
00:12:18,154 --> 00:12:21,574
[tense music swells]

215
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:35,838
Lily!

216
00:12:36,755 --> 00:12:37,840
Lily!

217
00:12:38,507 --> 00:12:41,385
Lily! Lily!

218
00:12:43,554 --> 00:12:44,889
Lily, dear!

219
00:12:45,764 --> 00:12:48,893
[tense music swells]

220
00:13:02,448 --> 00:13:07,161
[suspenseful music plays]

221
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:25,179
Let me out of here!

222
00:13:26,388 --> 00:13:28,390
Let me go!

223
00:13:32,436 --> 00:13:33,896
You bastards!

224
00:13:33,979 --> 00:13:35,648
[Camia breathes heavily]

225
00:13:36,148 --> 00:13:38,108
There's no point shouting.

226
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:39,860
No one will hear you anyway.

227
00:13:39,944 --> 00:13:41,987
And don't do anything stupid.

228
00:13:42,655 --> 00:13:44,031
Do you see those cameras?

229
00:13:44,573 --> 00:13:46,450
We're watching your every move.

230
00:13:52,248 --> 00:13:54,458
Don't even think about escaping.

231
00:13:55,834 --> 00:13:58,212
Just accept what's about to happen to you.

232
00:13:59,255 --> 00:14:01,173
You might end up liking it.

233
00:14:04,802 --> 00:14:06,595
Don't touch me!

234
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:08,138
You're pretty.

235
00:14:08,222 --> 00:14:10,975
-Don't touch me!
-Stop resisting. Come here.

236
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:19,608
Come closer.
There's nothing you can do now.

237
00:14:23,696 --> 00:14:25,364
Come here.

238
00:14:30,953 --> 00:14:33,372
[tense music plays]

239
00:14:50,431 --> 00:14:53,559
[tense music continues]

240
00:15:18,167 --> 00:15:19,209
[goon 3] Hey!

241
00:15:20,711 --> 00:15:22,087
How did you get there?!

242
00:15:24,214 --> 00:15:25,257
Go back there!

243
00:15:27,259 --> 00:15:28,469
Get back there!

244
00:15:35,559 --> 00:15:37,102
Stay still!

245
00:15:37,186 --> 00:15:38,771
[grunts]

246
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:41,899
Untie me right now!

247
00:15:41,982 --> 00:15:43,317
[gunshot]

248
00:15:44,193 --> 00:15:45,194
[goon 3] Well?!

249
00:15:46,403 --> 00:15:47,988
Do you want me to shoot you?

250
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:54,203
Just do as we say.

251
00:15:55,663 --> 00:15:57,373
-Or you'll get hurt--
-[Ivy grunts]

252
00:15:57,623 --> 00:15:58,832
Cut it out!

253
00:15:59,583 --> 00:16:01,043
I'll shoot you!

254
00:16:02,169 --> 00:16:03,587
Just do as we say!

255
00:16:05,506 --> 00:16:07,383
It's like you want to get hurt.

256
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:11,428
[tense music continues]

257
00:16:29,405 --> 00:16:30,864
[Romulo] Where's the other one?

258
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,167
[woman screams]

259
00:16:43,168 --> 00:16:45,045
[people panicking]

260
00:16:53,721 --> 00:16:56,265
[tense music playing]

261
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:05,816
You bastard!

262
00:17:09,111 --> 00:17:11,155
[grunting]

263
00:17:20,789 --> 00:17:24,793
[tense music swells]

264
00:17:47,691 --> 00:17:49,109
Untie me!

265
00:17:50,986 --> 00:17:52,696
[Helena chuckles]

266
00:17:58,077 --> 00:17:59,411
[Helena laughing]

267
00:17:59,495 --> 00:18:02,664
-[Julio] Whoa! [laughs]
-So feisty, this one!

268
00:18:03,957 --> 00:18:05,334
[Julio] Hey there, Lily!

269
00:18:06,668 --> 00:18:07,795
[Julio] Whoa.

270
00:18:07,878 --> 00:18:10,422
You can wiggle and jiggle,

271
00:18:10,506 --> 00:18:12,549
but you won't get out of there easily!

272
00:18:12,633 --> 00:18:14,384
Where's my mother, old man?!

273
00:18:14,468 --> 00:18:15,469
[Helena] Oh.

274
00:18:15,552 --> 00:18:19,098
You will soon be reunited with your mom

275
00:18:19,431 --> 00:18:21,016
in heaven.

276
00:18:21,308 --> 00:18:24,436
Oh, Helena, stop it.
Don't be too presumptuous.

277
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:28,524
Lily Cruz here is not
a goody-goody gumdrop!

278
00:18:28,607 --> 00:18:32,528
For all you know, she might
just end up going to hell.

279
00:18:32,611 --> 00:18:33,529
The River of Hades!

280
00:18:33,612 --> 00:18:34,613
[Lily] That's right!

281
00:18:35,155 --> 00:18:37,324
I'll make sure we'll see each other there

282
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:39,118
because you'll go there first!

283
00:18:40,369 --> 00:18:41,745
I'll get you first!

284
00:18:42,746 --> 00:18:44,248
-[grunting]
-[Julio] Okay.

285
00:18:44,331 --> 00:18:51,296
I am sure that I'm going to
enjoy hearing you scream.

286
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:54,633
-Oh my!
-[Helena and Julio chuckle]

287
00:18:58,345 --> 00:18:59,346
[groans]

288
00:18:59,429 --> 00:19:01,390
Goodbye, Lily Cruz.

289
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:05,060
Oh!

290
00:19:05,477 --> 00:19:08,438
[Julio] Watch it! I told you she's feisty!

291
00:19:08,522 --> 00:19:11,733
[Helena] You naughty girl. [chuckles]

292
00:19:12,151 --> 00:19:13,902
Bye-bye!

293
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:16,155
[Helena] Bye!

294
00:19:17,239 --> 00:19:18,657
[Lily] You have to forgive Helena.

295
00:19:18,740 --> 00:19:20,534
She gets rowdy at times.

296
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:22,995
Excuse me.

297
00:19:28,792 --> 00:19:30,794
Why did you let Romulo escape?!

298
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:34,548
He was our only hope
of finding Lily and Camia!

299
00:19:35,716 --> 00:19:38,552
Don't blame this on me.
Why did you let him escape?!

300
00:19:39,178 --> 00:19:41,054
If something happens to them,
I'll make you pay!

301
00:19:41,138 --> 00:19:44,474
If something happens to them,
you'll be sorry!

302
00:19:55,110 --> 00:19:57,696
[panting]

303
00:19:59,364 --> 00:20:01,366
[phone rings]

304
00:20:04,494 --> 00:20:05,579
Hello, Damian.

305
00:20:05,662 --> 00:20:06,663
You…

306
00:20:07,539 --> 00:20:10,292
I didn't take your resignation very well.

307
00:20:11,168 --> 00:20:12,294
[Helena] <i>In this industry…</i>

308
00:20:12,377 --> 00:20:15,589
…once you're in, the only way out

309
00:20:15,672 --> 00:20:17,132
is death!

310
00:20:17,966 --> 00:20:21,011
You monster! You're a monster, Red Dragon!

311
00:20:21,094 --> 00:20:22,763
You're no better than me!

312
00:20:23,096 --> 00:20:24,514
You want to change for the better?

313
00:20:24,598 --> 00:20:28,936
Well, being good doesn't suit you.

314
00:20:29,311 --> 00:20:32,022
<i>Once a criminal, always a criminal.</i>

315
00:20:32,105 --> 00:20:35,150
You can't wash the blood stains
off your hands!

316
00:20:36,777 --> 00:20:41,573
You know, your true self
will come out eventually.

317
00:20:41,657 --> 00:20:43,533
And that time is now!

318
00:20:43,617 --> 00:20:45,202
Where are Camia and Lily?!

319
00:20:45,285 --> 00:20:47,621
Take me instead!
Don't drag them into this!

320
00:20:49,039 --> 00:20:51,166
That's not going to be fun, is it?

321
00:20:51,875 --> 00:20:55,087
What I want is for all of you to suffer!

322
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:57,339
I'll make sure you suffer first!

323
00:20:58,423 --> 00:21:00,801
You and your whole family.

324
00:21:01,426 --> 00:21:03,136
I've been a loyal soldier to you.

325
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:06,765
I sold my soul to the devil
because of you!

326
00:21:07,015 --> 00:21:09,059
And this is what you do to me?!

327
00:21:09,142 --> 00:21:11,103
Because you're an ungrateful bastard!

328
00:21:12,688 --> 00:21:15,440
But, you know,
I like seeing this side of you.

329
00:21:15,524 --> 00:21:19,236
I miss the old bloodthirsty Jaguar.

330
00:21:19,861 --> 00:21:23,740
Stop trying to be a saint.
You're a criminal!

331
00:21:25,158 --> 00:21:29,538
Bring back your old self.
Bring the Jaguar back!

332
00:21:31,832 --> 00:21:34,251
Go to that place in 20 minutes,

333
00:21:35,419 --> 00:21:38,130
or your precious love will die.

334
00:21:41,174 --> 00:21:43,176
[laughs]

335
00:21:54,146 --> 00:21:55,564
[screams]

336
00:21:59,693 --> 00:22:01,069
[phone chimes]

337
00:22:08,118 --> 00:22:10,037
[ominous choir music playing]

338
00:22:10,370 --> 00:22:12,748
[Helena] <i>Go to the place</i>
<i>I'll send in 20 minutes.</i>

339
00:22:13,623 --> 00:22:16,376
<i>Or your precious love will die.</i>

340
00:22:18,712 --> 00:22:22,049
[ominous choir music continues]

341
00:22:34,686 --> 00:22:38,106
[ominous choir music swells]

342
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:58,460
Damian.

343
00:23:00,587 --> 00:23:01,880
[Camia] Damian.

344
00:23:08,595 --> 00:23:10,514
[Camia panting]

345
00:23:10,597 --> 00:23:12,265
[gunshot]

346
00:23:15,936 --> 00:23:17,270
[suspenseful music playing]

347
00:23:17,938 --> 00:23:21,817
No! Camia! Camia!

348
00:23:22,984 --> 00:23:24,319
[chuckles]

349
00:23:25,237 --> 00:23:26,279
Camia!

350
00:23:29,116 --> 00:23:30,450
Camia!

351
00:23:32,327 --> 00:23:34,412
Camia!

352
00:23:42,963 --> 00:23:46,007
[tense music swells]

353
00:24:03,567 --> 00:24:05,485
You won't die, Camia.

354
00:24:07,779 --> 00:24:10,490
I'll do everything I can to save you!

355
00:24:18,165 --> 00:24:20,167
[tense music continues]

356
00:24:27,174 --> 00:24:29,176
[chuckles]

357
00:24:35,015 --> 00:24:37,475
[phone rings]

358
00:24:39,394 --> 00:24:41,938
Hello, bastard.

359
00:24:42,606 --> 00:24:46,610
Damn you, Julio.
Let go of Lily and Auntie Camia!

360
00:24:46,693 --> 00:24:48,028
Sure, sure.

361
00:24:48,570 --> 00:24:52,741
But I want you to know,
it's not going to be easy.

362
00:24:52,824 --> 00:24:54,534
What do you want from me?

363
00:24:54,618 --> 00:24:56,578
What do you want from me?!

364
00:24:57,162 --> 00:25:00,373
I'll be sending you

365
00:25:00,457 --> 00:25:02,125
an address.

366
00:25:03,210 --> 00:25:04,336
[Julio] <i>And</i>

367
00:25:05,462 --> 00:25:11,051
you have to be there within
20 minutes of receiving it.

368
00:25:11,134 --> 00:25:12,844
<i>Because if not, if you arrive late</i>

369
00:25:12,928 --> 00:25:15,096
even by just a second,

370
00:25:15,180 --> 00:25:17,098
your precious love…

371
00:25:19,017 --> 00:25:19,893
will die.

372
00:25:22,479 --> 00:25:23,521
Bye.

373
00:25:24,981 --> 00:25:28,360
[tense music continues]

374
00:25:37,702 --> 00:25:40,622
[suspenseful music playing]

375
00:25:45,835 --> 00:25:49,339
Lily! Auntie Camia!

376
00:25:52,175 --> 00:25:53,385
Auntie Camia!

377
00:25:53,885 --> 00:25:54,928
Lily!

378
00:25:57,847 --> 00:26:00,100
Lily! Auntie Camia!

379
00:26:02,978 --> 00:26:04,187
[Diego] Damian!

380
00:26:05,146 --> 00:26:06,606
Did they call you too?

381
00:26:07,565 --> 00:26:10,902
Where are they?! Lily! Auntie Camia!

382
00:26:18,618 --> 00:26:22,038
[suspenseful music continues]

383
00:26:33,174 --> 00:26:35,218
Turn on the switch.

384
00:26:40,181 --> 00:26:42,183
[wine pouring]

385
00:26:54,821 --> 00:26:57,324
That's Dante Cruz! He's alive?!

386
00:26:59,159 --> 00:27:00,452
He's not Dante.

387
00:27:01,244 --> 00:27:02,662
That's his brother Damian.

388
00:27:03,163 --> 00:27:05,832
-What?
-He is the real Jaguar.

389
00:27:06,374 --> 00:27:09,878
Original Jaguar. I know.
And there's a fake one.

390
00:27:11,129 --> 00:27:12,380
That's it!

391
00:27:12,464 --> 00:27:16,968
So, that Damian is related
to Lily and Camia!

392
00:27:17,052 --> 00:27:19,846
I get it now, Mama! I get it!

393
00:27:21,556 --> 00:27:25,018
Yes, and that is why I love you so much.

394
00:27:25,101 --> 00:27:27,395
-You're so smart, baby girl!
-[giggles]

395
00:27:27,687 --> 00:27:30,148
Of course! I just knew
I always took after you.

396
00:27:30,231 --> 00:27:32,275
And for sure, not from papa.

397
00:27:33,026 --> 00:27:35,820
Where is that man, anyway?
The show is about to begin!

398
00:27:36,321 --> 00:27:38,656
He's attending to some matters.
But he'll join us later.

399
00:27:41,159 --> 00:27:42,369
I love you, grandson!

400
00:27:42,869 --> 00:27:44,245
-Great!
-[Emilia] Hmm…

401
00:27:44,746 --> 00:27:46,831
[Helena] Let's get the popcorn ready.

402
00:27:47,540 --> 00:27:48,291
[static]

403
00:27:55,298 --> 00:27:56,299
Now…

404
00:27:56,925 --> 00:27:58,218
Where were we?

405
00:27:58,885 --> 00:28:00,303
Let me go!

406
00:28:01,096 --> 00:28:02,347
Why?

407
00:28:03,723 --> 00:28:07,394
You know, Lily, I did not
come here to chat with you.

408
00:28:07,477 --> 00:28:09,145
[Julio] I came here

409
00:28:09,229 --> 00:28:13,900
to make sure you'll see
your loved ones' last moments.

410
00:28:14,484 --> 00:28:15,902
[Julio] I want you

411
00:28:16,486 --> 00:28:21,491
to watch them beg, suffer, and bleed!

412
00:28:22,325 --> 00:28:23,827
And I want you to remember

413
00:28:25,120 --> 00:28:26,871
that they're in that situation…

414
00:28:27,247 --> 00:28:30,792
[tense music playing]

415
00:28:31,042 --> 00:28:33,169
…all because of you!

416
00:28:34,045 --> 00:28:37,632
You! Make her watch! Make her watch!

417
00:28:38,216 --> 00:28:42,387
I want you to watch
each of your loved ones die

418
00:28:42,470 --> 00:28:45,390
a slow, painful death!

419
00:28:45,890 --> 00:28:49,978
[Lily] Make her watch! Watch, Lily Cruz!

420
00:28:55,525 --> 00:29:00,029
We're about to watch
something spectacular!

421
00:29:00,113 --> 00:29:03,158
[laughs]

422
00:29:16,171 --> 00:29:21,176
<i>Good day gentleman and pussycat!</i>

423
00:29:24,304 --> 00:29:26,431
[Helena on monitor]
<i>I'm sure you recognize my voice.</i>

424
00:29:29,809 --> 00:29:31,895
<i>I'm sure that you're</i>

425
00:29:31,978 --> 00:29:36,149
both searching for
the loves of your lives.

426
00:29:36,733 --> 00:29:39,235
[Helena] The women you idiots

427
00:29:39,319 --> 00:29:41,029
fell in love with!

428
00:29:41,529 --> 00:29:44,365
[tense music continues]

429
00:29:44,991 --> 00:29:48,077
[Lily] You monster… You monster!

430
00:29:51,998 --> 00:29:53,708
-[Julio] Whoa.
-[Lily] Bastard!

431
00:29:56,044 --> 00:29:57,420
[Julio] You exposed my knife!

432
00:29:57,962 --> 00:30:01,549
What if I cut you into little pieces?!

433
00:30:01,883 --> 00:30:05,929
But I don't wanna do that.
You have nice skin.

434
00:30:06,012 --> 00:30:08,139
[laughs]

435
00:30:08,223 --> 00:30:09,474
[Helena on monitor] <i>But don't worry.</i>

436
00:30:09,557 --> 00:30:11,518
I'm gonna give them to you.

437
00:30:11,893 --> 00:30:15,814
<i>But only one of you will get</i>
<i>their heart's desire.</i>

438
00:30:16,898 --> 00:30:19,275
<i>Now, let's see whose love is stronger.</i>

439
00:30:20,401 --> 00:30:22,237
<i>Is it Damian's love for Camia?</i>

440
00:30:23,196 --> 00:30:24,072
[Helena] Or

441
00:30:24,155 --> 00:30:27,033
<i>is it Diego's love for Lily?</i>

442
00:30:28,493 --> 00:30:30,453
[laugh]

443
00:30:30,870 --> 00:30:34,374
[Helena on monitor] <i>How far</i>
<i>will you go for love?</i>

444
00:30:34,833 --> 00:30:39,546
Are you willing to kill
for that person you love?

445
00:30:40,922 --> 00:30:42,507
[tense music swells]

446
00:30:42,590 --> 00:30:44,384
[laughs]

447
00:30:50,515 --> 00:30:52,976
[laughs]

448
00:30:54,769 --> 00:30:57,272
[Julio] Like I told you, you can

449
00:30:57,355 --> 00:31:00,149
try all night.

450
00:31:00,692 --> 00:31:02,068
But, news flash!

451
00:31:02,151 --> 00:31:03,611
You're never getting out of that chair.

452
00:31:03,695 --> 00:31:05,405
You're never going to escape.

453
00:31:05,488 --> 00:31:07,240
Because tonight, Lily Cruz--

454
00:31:07,323 --> 00:31:08,449
"You're going to die, Lily Cruz!"

455
00:31:08,533 --> 00:31:09,450
Yes.

456
00:31:09,534 --> 00:31:13,454
"We'll kill you, Lily Cruz!"

457
00:31:13,538 --> 00:31:15,832
"This is your last night, Lily Cruz!"

458
00:31:15,915 --> 00:31:17,250
"Tomorrow, you'll be dead!"

459
00:31:17,333 --> 00:31:22,297
Blah, blah, blah!
That's all I ever hear you say!

460
00:31:22,380 --> 00:31:26,593
I even heard that from underground,

461
00:31:26,676 --> 00:31:28,386
when you buried me alive!

462
00:31:28,469 --> 00:31:33,892
But, what now?
I'm still here, very much alive!

463
00:31:34,601 --> 00:31:38,021
That's a news flash for you,
Julio Ardiente!

464
00:31:38,104 --> 00:31:41,274
-[Julio clicking his tongue]
-Lily Cruz is alive.

465
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:45,111
So, please stop threatening me,

466
00:31:45,194 --> 00:31:47,530
because it's getting annoying!

467
00:31:47,614 --> 00:31:49,616
[chuckles]

468
00:31:49,908 --> 00:31:51,451
[Julio] Lily Cruz…

469
00:31:51,534 --> 00:31:57,707
Lily Cruz and her far-reaching fantasies!

470
00:31:58,041 --> 00:32:00,752
[laughs]

471
00:32:01,628 --> 00:32:04,297
A fact I will tell you is

472
00:32:04,380 --> 00:32:07,842
that all your loved ones
will die very soon.

473
00:32:08,885 --> 00:32:15,600
But, there is this little detail
that I want you to remember.

474
00:32:17,268 --> 00:32:22,523
My people aren't going to
kill them as you'd expect.

475
00:32:23,691 --> 00:32:25,318
You know what's going to happen?

476
00:32:25,818 --> 00:32:29,238
They're going to kill each other!

477
00:32:29,697 --> 00:32:31,699
-[ominous choir music plays]
-[chains clinking]

478
00:32:36,371 --> 00:32:37,705
[Helena on monitor] <i>There's a gun hidden</i>

479
00:32:37,789 --> 00:32:40,083
<i>somewhere in that warehouse.</i>

480
00:32:41,167 --> 00:32:44,712
<i>And you have to find that gun and use it</i>

481
00:32:45,213 --> 00:32:47,924
<i>against each other. Yes.</i>

482
00:32:48,841 --> 00:32:51,052
<i>You want to be with your lovers?</i>

483
00:32:51,886 --> 00:32:55,223
[Helena] Then, you have to end

484
00:32:55,306 --> 00:33:00,520
each other's life with a single bullet.

485
00:33:01,354 --> 00:33:05,858
Then, you'll be with your beloved.

486
00:33:08,403 --> 00:33:12,573
Damian. My favorite lieutenant.

487
00:33:13,992 --> 00:33:15,994
<i>If you kill Diego,</i>

488
00:33:16,077 --> 00:33:19,831
Camia lives. But, Lily dies.

489
00:33:21,749 --> 00:33:27,922
<i>And Diego. If you kill Damian, Lily lives!</i>

490
00:33:28,214 --> 00:33:31,426
But, that means
her noble mother, Camia, dies.

491
00:33:31,801 --> 00:33:33,219
You monster!

492
00:33:33,302 --> 00:33:35,096
[laughs]

493
00:33:37,265 --> 00:33:39,142
[Helena] <i>So, hmm?</i>

494
00:33:40,059 --> 00:33:43,521
<i>What will it be? Let the games begin!</i>

495
00:33:43,855 --> 00:33:46,816
[tense music plays]

496
00:33:48,526 --> 00:33:50,570
<i>Happy hunting!</i>

497
00:33:52,196 --> 00:33:53,114
-[Helena] Cheers!
-[clinking]

498
00:33:53,197 --> 00:33:55,825
[Emilia] Cheers! Cheers! This is it.

499
00:33:56,451 --> 00:34:01,122
[tense music continues]

500
00:34:04,667 --> 00:34:08,838
[Helena] Hey! Are you going to
stand there all day?

501
00:34:09,505 --> 00:34:11,257
The game of death has begun!

502
00:34:11,340 --> 00:34:13,217
<i>What do you want?! A damn whistle?!</i>

503
00:34:14,802 --> 00:34:16,512
We won't give you what you want!

504
00:34:16,596 --> 00:34:17,889
We're not going to kill each other!

505
00:34:17,972 --> 00:34:20,808
Just give us back Lily and Auntie Camia!

506
00:34:24,437 --> 00:34:25,354
Really?

507
00:34:25,438 --> 00:34:27,106
<i>Is that so, Diego?</i>

508
00:34:27,190 --> 00:34:30,234
<i>Why don't you take a look</i>
<i>at that man beside you?</i>

509
00:34:30,318 --> 00:34:36,115
<i>Why, isn't it my best minion, Jaguar?</i>

510
00:34:38,201 --> 00:34:41,829
<i>If you only knew</i>
<i>the things Jaguar has done…</i>

511
00:34:43,039 --> 00:34:47,126
Despicable is an understatement.

512
00:34:50,338 --> 00:34:52,924
[Damian on monitor] Do you think
I'm stupid, Red Dragon?

513
00:34:54,092 --> 00:34:57,220
You don't have any proof
that you have Camia and Lily!

514
00:35:00,181 --> 00:35:03,851
Of course, Damian.
You've got a criminal mind.

515
00:35:03,935 --> 00:35:05,394
But don't you forget…

516
00:35:05,478 --> 00:35:07,897
<i>I am the leader. You are just a minion.</i>

517
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:09,857
I'm two steps ahead of you.

518
00:35:10,775 --> 00:35:12,819
[snaps] Monitors, please.

519
00:35:17,156 --> 00:35:18,241
[Lily on monitor] <i>You monsters!</i>

520
00:35:18,324 --> 00:35:20,076
-<i>Let me out of here!</i>
-Lily!

521
00:35:20,159 --> 00:35:21,911
Camia! Red Dragon

522
00:35:21,994 --> 00:35:23,246
<i>you monster!</i>

523
00:35:27,125 --> 00:35:29,877
You criminals! Give them back!

524
00:35:31,796 --> 00:35:33,089
What do you want?

525
00:35:33,172 --> 00:35:38,427
Two cold, lifeless corpses in your hands?

526
00:35:38,803 --> 00:35:41,305
[Helena chuckles] Now, move it!

527
00:35:42,557 --> 00:35:43,808
Eight hours!

528
00:35:44,559 --> 00:35:46,727
<i>I'm giving you eight hours</i>
<i>to kill each other</i>

529
00:35:46,811 --> 00:35:48,396
in cold blood.

530
00:35:48,980 --> 00:35:52,066
If neither of you dies within eight hours,

531
00:35:53,442 --> 00:35:56,112
Lily and Camia

532
00:35:56,195 --> 00:35:57,530
<i>will both die.</i>

533
00:35:58,197 --> 00:35:59,115
<i>And I'll kill the both</i>

534
00:35:59,198 --> 00:36:02,493
of you too so you can all burn in hell!

535
00:36:07,957 --> 00:36:09,500
<i>Come on, fighters!</i>

536
00:36:09,584 --> 00:36:11,043
Fight to the death!

537
00:36:11,127 --> 00:36:12,837
Fight for your survival!

538
00:36:12,920 --> 00:36:15,298
Fight for the survival of your witches!

539
00:36:15,673 --> 00:36:22,221
Find the damn gun and give me
some red, hot, sticky blood!

540
00:36:22,763 --> 00:36:24,098
[Diego] Eight hours.

541
00:36:24,557 --> 00:36:26,976
We only have eight hours left. Come on!

542
00:36:27,810 --> 00:36:30,271
[tense music playing]

543
00:36:30,897 --> 00:36:34,901
[laughing]

544
00:36:41,616 --> 00:36:43,159
Cheers, mama!

545
00:36:43,701 --> 00:36:46,913
-Cheers!
-Oh, this is so exciting!

546
00:36:47,413 --> 00:36:51,209
Blood for blood, Lily Cruz.

547
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:58,591
You know, Lily Cruz your veins
will bleed dry

548
00:36:59,175 --> 00:37:04,764
if Damian kills that bastard Diego.

549
00:37:05,723 --> 00:37:10,686
But if he doesn't,
then Camia Cruz, your mother,

550
00:37:10,770 --> 00:37:12,688
will swim in her own blood

551
00:37:13,731 --> 00:37:18,694
if Diego the bastard kills Damian.

552
00:37:20,154 --> 00:37:21,155
See?

553
00:37:21,530 --> 00:37:25,618
Now isn't that brilliant?

554
00:37:26,702 --> 00:37:30,748
Come on, Lily. You have to give us that.

555
00:37:31,916 --> 00:37:36,504
Uh-oh. Relax, relax.
You might hurt yourself.

556
00:37:37,046 --> 00:37:39,423
Now. A question.

557
00:37:39,882 --> 00:37:41,133
How?

558
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:46,597
How will the great Lily Cruz

559
00:37:47,598 --> 00:37:51,185
get out of this dilemma
she brought upon herself?

560
00:37:53,020 --> 00:37:55,439
Now, may I ask you, Lily.

561
00:37:55,523 --> 00:37:58,025
Who's the idiot now?!

562
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,529
[laughs, spits]

563
00:38:02,905 --> 00:38:05,533
[tense music continues]

564
00:38:05,616 --> 00:38:06,617
[Diego] Hey, Damian!

565
00:38:07,285 --> 00:38:08,661
[clanking]

566
00:38:12,331 --> 00:38:14,375
Damian! Get moving!

567
00:38:17,169 --> 00:38:19,880
Hey! Damian, do something!

568
00:38:23,634 --> 00:38:26,595
[tense music swells]

569
00:38:43,404 --> 00:38:45,740
<i>Camia! Camia!</i>

570
00:38:53,414 --> 00:38:56,959
[Diego] Hey! What are you doing?
Listen to me.

571
00:38:57,293 --> 00:39:00,171
Don't listen to Red Dragon.
She's manipulating us!

572
00:39:00,254 --> 00:39:03,924
We can't let her get to us.
We'll work together. Let's go.

573
00:39:04,508 --> 00:39:06,010
No, Diego.

574
00:39:06,552 --> 00:39:08,888
-[Diego on monitor] <i>Hey!</i>
-That's it! That's it, Damian!

575
00:39:08,971 --> 00:39:11,515
Kill Diego! Kill him!

576
00:39:11,849 --> 00:39:12,725
[Helena chuckles]

577
00:39:13,392 --> 00:39:16,270
We need to move. We need to move!

578
00:39:16,354 --> 00:39:18,773
Come on! Snap out of it!

579
00:39:19,857 --> 00:39:21,817
Arnaldo, who are you betting for?

580
00:39:22,193 --> 00:39:24,820
Wrong question.
It's who I'm betting against.

581
00:39:24,904 --> 00:39:27,573
[laughs] I bet it's Damian.

582
00:39:27,656 --> 00:39:30,743
[Emilia] Because no matter
how much Lily Cruz hurt you,

583
00:39:30,826 --> 00:39:32,453
you're still head over heels for her.

584
00:39:32,536 --> 00:39:34,538
-Love, love, love.
-Yeah, yeah.

585
00:39:34,622 --> 00:39:36,665
I fell in love, okay?

586
00:39:36,749 --> 00:39:39,251
But love kills. You know?

587
00:39:39,627 --> 00:39:43,297
Sometimes, you'd rather lose
the person you love along

588
00:39:43,381 --> 00:39:45,633
with the person they replaced you with.

589
00:39:45,716 --> 00:39:47,218
-[Emilia scoffs]
-Right?

590
00:39:48,886 --> 00:39:50,179
Like you.

591
00:39:50,679 --> 00:39:53,516
If dad was there fighting for his life,

592
00:39:55,810 --> 00:39:56,936
would you bet on him?

593
00:40:00,689 --> 00:40:02,358
[Helena] More popcorn.

594
00:40:08,656 --> 00:40:10,032
We need to move.

595
00:40:10,116 --> 00:40:11,784
Let go of me!

596
00:40:11,867 --> 00:40:12,785
What?!

597
00:40:14,662 --> 00:40:16,247
No matter how much you try

598
00:40:16,330 --> 00:40:19,583
to find a way out,
it won't change a thing.

599
00:40:21,043 --> 00:40:22,795
What are you saying?!

600
00:40:23,337 --> 00:40:24,880
Use your head!

601
00:40:25,881 --> 00:40:29,093
I know Red Dragon!
She does everything she says!

602
00:40:29,176 --> 00:40:32,346
She doesn't joke around!
Look! Look around you!

603
00:40:32,721 --> 00:40:36,016
She has eyes everywhere!
You think she'd let us escape?

604
00:40:36,100 --> 00:40:37,810
So what?! We'll just let them die?!

605
00:40:37,893 --> 00:40:40,020
Do you think we can get
out of here alive?!

606
00:40:40,646 --> 00:40:41,814
Listen to me.

607
00:40:41,897 --> 00:40:45,693
We need to work together to save them.

608
00:40:47,027 --> 00:40:48,237
Do you understand?

609
00:40:48,320 --> 00:40:55,661
Diego. This isn't a dream.
Wake up! Time's running out!

610
00:40:55,744 --> 00:40:59,415
Seven hours! What are we going to do?

611
00:40:59,623 --> 00:41:02,877
If we don't do anything,
Lily or Camia will die!

612
00:41:03,294 --> 00:41:06,839
Put that in your head!
Only one of them can survive!

613
00:41:07,131 --> 00:41:09,842
And only one of us can die!

614
00:41:10,551 --> 00:41:12,136
And that's you!

615
00:41:13,512 --> 00:41:16,307
[grunting]

616
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:21,020
Yes! The man is a beast!

617
00:41:21,103 --> 00:41:22,146
Damian!

618
00:41:22,438 --> 00:41:24,356
You're going to die.

619
00:41:24,690 --> 00:41:27,109
-We're on the same side!
-Say your prayers!

620
00:41:30,112 --> 00:41:32,531
-Go!
-Their group is falling apart

621
00:41:32,615 --> 00:41:36,410
because they're turning on each other.

622
00:41:36,744 --> 00:41:39,580
-[Emilia cheering]
-And all for Lily Cruz!

623
00:41:40,164 --> 00:41:41,165
[Emilia chuckling]

624
00:41:41,957 --> 00:41:42,958
[Helena] Emilia.

625
00:41:43,751 --> 00:41:46,504
We'll finally get revenge for
everything she put you through.

626
00:41:46,587 --> 00:41:48,088
-Yes.
-Victory is sweet!

627
00:41:48,172 --> 00:41:49,924
-Whoo!
-Yes!

628
00:41:50,007 --> 00:41:52,009
[Emilia laughing]

629
00:41:53,010 --> 00:41:56,805
[Julio] Do me a favor.
Choose one. Right now.

630
00:41:57,848 --> 00:42:03,270
But just one. Be honest.
Who do you want to win?

631
00:42:03,646 --> 00:42:06,649
Or… who do you want to live?

632
00:42:07,191 --> 00:42:14,156
Diego, who was the reason
you drove my grandson insane…

633
00:42:15,407 --> 00:42:18,911
Or your beloved mother, Camia?

634
00:42:20,663 --> 00:42:24,667
Choose. Choose well, my dear.

635
00:42:26,085 --> 00:42:27,920
[Julio sighs]

636
00:42:28,379 --> 00:42:30,422
[yelling]

637
00:42:31,674 --> 00:42:33,676
[grunts]

638
00:42:42,851 --> 00:42:44,979
[chuckling]

639
00:42:45,354 --> 00:42:46,397
What's funny?

640
00:42:47,147 --> 00:42:49,942
We've been fighting for a long time,

641
00:42:50,484 --> 00:42:53,320
and yet you still don't know
who you're going up against?!

642
00:42:53,654 --> 00:42:54,613
Moron!

643
00:42:55,114 --> 00:42:57,032
[Lily] For your information…

644
00:42:57,908 --> 00:43:00,536
You'll never defeat me!

645
00:43:01,161 --> 00:43:02,871
You never will!

646
00:43:03,622 --> 00:43:08,210
What I fight for,
Julio Ardiente, means something.

647
00:43:09,336 --> 00:43:16,635
And all the ones I care for
believe in the same thing I do!

648
00:43:17,469 --> 00:43:21,348
[Lily] They know how to be brave
and how to be smart!

649
00:43:23,017 --> 00:43:26,395
So, I know they won't kill each other!

650
00:43:26,478 --> 00:43:28,772
[tense music swells]

651
00:43:33,110 --> 00:43:35,070
And I can assure you…

652
00:43:35,154 --> 00:43:38,032
Your days are numbered, old man!

653
00:43:38,115 --> 00:43:39,408
[laughs]

654
00:43:40,784 --> 00:43:43,037
Your eyes are about to pop out.

655
00:43:49,001 --> 00:43:51,712
[grunting]

656
00:43:54,256 --> 00:43:56,467
[Emilia] That's it! Come on! Yes!

657
00:43:56,550 --> 00:43:58,093
-Go!
-[Emilia] Game!

658
00:43:58,177 --> 00:44:00,179
[Emilia laughs]

659
00:44:01,722 --> 00:44:02,473
[chokes]

660
00:44:02,556 --> 00:44:04,433
[Arnaldo] Oh. Oh.

661
00:44:04,516 --> 00:44:06,143
-Hey. Are you okay?
-Give me some water!

662
00:44:06,226 --> 00:44:08,354
-[Arnaldo] Water. Here.
-[Emilia coughing]

663
00:44:08,437 --> 00:44:11,440
I got so excited! Oh, not that.

664
00:44:12,274 --> 00:44:13,400
[Emilia] Hurry.

665
00:44:16,028 --> 00:44:19,782
[grunting]

666
00:44:21,700 --> 00:44:23,661
[tense music playing]

667
00:44:47,768 --> 00:44:49,311
[birds chirping]

668
00:44:49,395 --> 00:44:51,605
[henchman] Boss. Lily Cruz?

669
00:44:51,980 --> 00:44:54,024
What does she have to do with us?

670
00:44:54,108 --> 00:44:55,943
Why do we have to save her?

671
00:44:59,071 --> 00:45:00,572
Just do as I say.

672
00:45:00,656 --> 00:45:02,699
I don't think that's fair, Jaguar.

673
00:45:02,783 --> 00:45:05,702
You leave us to conduct
operations on our own.

674
00:45:06,453 --> 00:45:09,248
You don't show up often,
and this is what we get from you?

675
00:45:10,082 --> 00:45:12,418
Lily Cruz is an influential person.

676
00:45:12,709 --> 00:45:16,171
She'll be indebted to us
once we win her trust.

677
00:45:16,672 --> 00:45:19,383
That's why we need to do this, understand?

678
00:45:20,092 --> 00:45:24,596
But, Jaguar, someone
more powerful wants to hire us.

679
00:45:25,764 --> 00:45:28,684
And, I think, they're more
influential than Lily Cruz.

680
00:45:28,767 --> 00:45:30,144
You know, you're getting on my nerves.

681
00:45:30,227 --> 00:45:32,855
What are you getting at?
Who are you talking about?

682
00:45:39,319 --> 00:45:41,029
<i>Do you accept Lady N's offer?</i>

683
00:45:42,990 --> 00:45:44,324
<i>Good to hear!</i>

684
00:45:44,825 --> 00:45:47,786
<i>This is your first paycheck.</i>
<i>For joining us.</i>

685
00:45:49,663 --> 00:45:53,125
<i>We are pleased to be of service to Lady N.</i>

686
00:45:55,419 --> 00:45:58,755
To tell you the truth, Jaguar,
we already made a deal with her,

687
00:45:58,839 --> 00:46:01,258
and I and my men
will start working for her now.

688
00:46:03,218 --> 00:46:06,430
I'm sorry, Jaguar. It's just business.

689
00:46:06,513 --> 00:46:07,723
Nothing personal.

690
00:46:09,766 --> 00:46:11,185
Till we meet again.

691
00:46:11,685 --> 00:46:12,936
Let's go.

692
00:46:14,188 --> 00:46:16,690
[tense music continues]

693
00:46:30,496 --> 00:46:33,081
-[phone ringing]
-Oh, speak of the devil.

694
00:46:33,999 --> 00:46:35,209
Hello, Raul.

695
00:46:35,292 --> 00:46:36,210
Emilia!

696
00:46:36,293 --> 00:46:37,419
[Raul] <i>Where are you?</i>

697
00:46:37,503 --> 00:46:39,713
I am somewhere in between
"what do you care?"

698
00:46:39,796 --> 00:46:41,465
and "mind your own business".

699
00:46:42,216 --> 00:46:42,966
Calm down, Emilia.

700
00:46:43,050 --> 00:46:46,136
I just called because I missed you.

701
00:46:47,471 --> 00:46:48,847
<i>Do you want me to pick you up?</i>

702
00:46:48,931 --> 00:46:50,474
Why don't we go out?

703
00:46:51,099 --> 00:46:56,772
I mean, if you love someone,

704
00:46:56,855 --> 00:46:58,357
<i>you'll do anything for them, right?</i>

705
00:46:59,107 --> 00:47:01,777
Okay, fine. Let's meet up.

706
00:47:03,195 --> 00:47:04,488
I'll see you.

707
00:47:08,659 --> 00:47:11,161
Men are so needy nowadays!

708
00:47:20,212 --> 00:47:23,465
[tense music playing]

709
00:47:32,933 --> 00:47:35,602
[grunting]

710
00:47:46,196 --> 00:47:47,990
Damian! Listen to me!

711
00:47:48,073 --> 00:47:51,201
If you kill me, then it'll be
like you killed Lily too!

712
00:47:51,285 --> 00:47:53,203
We're talking about your niece here!

713
00:47:53,996 --> 00:47:56,456
[yelling]

714
00:47:57,165 --> 00:47:58,959
All my life, I've always ended up losing!

715
00:47:59,042 --> 00:48:02,004
I always make sacrifices!
I always compromise!

716
00:48:04,881 --> 00:48:06,842
[grunting]

717
00:48:07,467 --> 00:48:12,598
But if you kill Lily, tell me,
how will Camia ever love you?

718
00:48:16,059 --> 00:48:18,186
I've lost Camia lots of times before!

719
00:48:18,270 --> 00:48:20,147
I won't let that happen again!

720
00:48:20,230 --> 00:48:23,191
In the end, it's us who will survive!

721
00:48:23,275 --> 00:48:25,736
[grunting]

722
00:48:29,281 --> 00:48:32,534
[tense music swells]

723
00:48:52,471 --> 00:48:54,222
[Raul] <i>You're telling me</i>
<i>that Diego's missing?</i>

724
00:48:54,306 --> 00:48:55,098
[Raul grunts]

725
00:48:55,182 --> 00:48:57,559
<i>Everyone has their secrets,</i>
<i>Raul. Deal with it.</i>

726
00:48:57,643 --> 00:49:01,438
[Julio] <i>My henchman is</i>
<i>pulling down his pants zipper</i>

727
00:49:01,521 --> 00:49:04,650
<i>because he's going to rape your mother!</i>

728
00:49:04,733 --> 00:49:08,153
[Lily] <i>I will end you, Julio Ardiente!</i>

729
00:49:08,403 --> 00:49:11,073
<i>You and your family will perish!</i>

730
00:49:11,156 --> 00:49:13,700
[Julio] <i>And this will make you shut up!</i>

731
00:49:13,784 --> 00:49:15,285
[groans]

732
00:49:15,369 --> 00:49:17,454
[Damian] <i>I'm looking for the gun</i>
<i>that will kill you!</i>

733
00:49:17,537 --> 00:49:19,247
<i>Instead of yapping,</i>
<i>why don't you look for the gun,</i>

734
00:49:19,331 --> 00:49:20,332
<i>so you can save Lily?</i>

735
00:49:20,415 --> 00:49:23,418
<i>Looking for this?! Are you ready to die?</i>

736
00:49:24,586 --> 00:49:25,587
[gunshot]

737
00:49:25,671 --> 00:49:28,256
[theme music playing]
